0 FILE 10022 - main.ldr
0 Santa Fe Super Chief Dining Car (set 10022-1) — a light grey and dark grey passenger train dining car with grilled side panels, glazed windows, a windowed engineer's end cab with headlight bricks, opening side doors with glass, a curved-arch roof, an interior with minifig seats, tables, cups and a suitcase, red/green/yellow round tail-light plates, Santa Fe Super Chief Indian-head emblem and SANTA FE lettering stickers, and two single-axle wheel bogies with magnetic couplings
0 Name: 10022 - main.ldr
0 Author: TotalyWicked [TotalyWicked]
