0 FILE 10022 - train car.ldr
0 Dining car body on a 6 x 28 train base with grilled side panels, glazed hollow-stud window panels and a windowed end cab with headlight bricks, log-textured pillars, opening side doors with glass, round green/yellow/red tail-light plates, a curved-arch roof of curved-top bricks, interior with brown minifig seats, white table plates, red minifig cups and a brown suitcase, and Santa Fe Super Chief Indian-head emblem plus SANTA FE and 2417 lettering stickers
